{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日のブログの1枚目の集合写真、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正解は！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"③の、グアムで夜ご飯食べる前の\n写真でした〜\\( ˆoˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後ろのプールが大きなヒントになったかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結構簡単かな...と思っていたら\n意外と皆さん悩んでくれたみたいで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"問題を出した方としては\nしてやったりです( ˘ω˘ )ふふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思わずこの笑顔。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/14/8078778/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょんまげ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"！ChihAnswer！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/14/8078778/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Kフミさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・おにぎりの具はなにが好きですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→シンプルなのでいうと明太子！\nあとは天むすも好き。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お母さんが作ってくれていた\nチーズとおかかとしそと少しのお醤油\nで握られたおにぎりは\nとっても美味しかった\\( ˆoˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/14/8078778/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Yuna♬さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・ちはるちゃんが今運動するならどんなスポーツがしたいですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→やっぱり、バスケがしたい！！\nゴリゴリのバスケ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"習っていたのは小学校の頃だから\nかなりブランクあるけど\n本気でバスケがしたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/14/8078778/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"成さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・岡山のアンダラ行くねんけどちーちゃんのサイリウムカラーにしてちーちゃんのタオル掲げてたらみえるかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→絶対見える！\nというか、見つけるよ！\\( ˆoˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"赤と青プラス、タオルなんて\n最強コンビだよ〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/14/8078778/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"三歳のサイ⊿さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・ちーちゃんがもしラジオにメールを送るとしたらどんなラジオネームにする？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→ひとみちゃんにする！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"理由は、私の祖父が、\n私が小さい頃とても目が大きすぎだ！と\n思ったのか、何故か私のことを\nひとみちゃんと呼んでいたから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるちゃんとはあんまり呼ばず\n「目が大きいからひとみちゃんだな！ははは」\nと笑っていたみたい。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マイペースな性格は\n祖父から受け継いだのかな〜笑\nと勝手に思ってます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"祖父の生前エピソードの中の\n面白い話、五本の指に入るかも。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/14/8078778/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにこの子がひとみちゃん。\n(斎藤ちはる、生まれて数ヶ月)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/14/8078778/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Sudaさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・テレビ番組の収録の時と握手会の時はメイクの仕方とか変えてるんですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→ほぼ一緒だけど、\nアイシャドウの色だけ変えてるよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"収録や、撮影のときは\nゴールドや茶色系で少し大人っぽく。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会やオフの時は\nピンクで少し雰囲気を柔らかく。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/14/8078778/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪住みかずきさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・ちーちゃんが今まで旅行とかで行ったところでここはオススメ！ってところはある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→小さい頃に何回か行って\n曖昧な子供ながらの感想でも\n凄い楽しかった、景色が綺麗だったって\n思うのは日本だと 初島 かな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"２０歳直前の今行ったら\n子供の頃とはまた見える景色も違うと思うから\n私自身もまた行きたい〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/14/8078778/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"埼玉っ子さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・もしこの世に食べ物が一種類しか無くなるとして、その一種類を自分で決められるとしたらちーちゃんはなにを選ぶ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→真面目に、親子丼！とか\nスコーン！とか、タコライス！とか\n肉じゃが！とか、豚汁！とか\nオムライス！とか色々考えたんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は 日替わり定食にする。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっとずる賢すぎ？笑( ˘ω˘ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はここまで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん今日も沢山ありがとう(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/14/8078778/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お礼に、グアムで撮った\n後ろの犬？銅像？と同じ顔してる顔(？)の\n写真あげる( ◦˙ ˙◦ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♬ ChihaMusic"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「トレモロ」RADWIMPSさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌詞を検索して見ているんだけど\nなんか涙がてできそうになる。\n素敵すぎて。\n出だしも好き！息継ぎからの\n\"満天の空に君の声が\n響いてもいいような綺麗な夜\""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"筋肉痛が遅れてき始めた。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ついに、私も。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悲しき。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少し悲しそうな顔してる私。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/14/8078778/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日も朝早い！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張る！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}